### Code review
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "java",
  "code": "public int dividir(int a, int b) { return a / b; }"
}

### Gerar testes
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "className": "Calculadora",
  "code": "public class Calculadora { public int somar(int a, int b) { return a + b; } }"
}

### Explicar código
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/explanations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "java",
  "code": "list.stream().filter(n -> n % 2 == 0).map(n -> n * n).toList();",
  "level": "BEGINNER"
}

### Histórico
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/history?page=0&size=10&type=REVIEW

### Detalhe
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/history/1
